        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 1:50AM PDT until September 25 at 11:00AM PDT by NWS Portland OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...South winds 10 to 20 mph with gusts up to 45 mph expected.

* WHERE...In Oregon, Clackamas County Cascade Foothills and Lower
Columbia River Counties. In Washington, Cowlitz County Lowlands,
South Washington Cascade Foothills, and Willapa Hills Counties.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM PDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Full leaf cover on trees may result in trees
or limbs suffering wind damage at lower wind speeds than usual.
Exacerbated impacts possible as a result.
</description>
        <instruction>Use extra caution when driving, especially if operating a high
profile vehicle. Secure outdoor objects such as garbage cans and
other objects that can easily blow around.</instruction>
